    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18529" root="زيل" body-key="z">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انزال</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, put,</i> or <i>set, apart,
away,</i> or <i>aside; removed;</i> or <i>separated;</i> (S, K;)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ</span> [<i>from him,</i> or <i>it</i>]. (TA.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِلْتُهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلَمْ يَنْزَلْ</span>: see 1. (S, K.) [See also 5. And see
7 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زول</span>.]

